 degrees</span></span></span> slope downhill <span data-figure="">135<span data-unit="°" data-tooltip="degrees"><span aria-hidden="true">°</span><span data-unit-word=""> degrees</span></span></span> · 3 km downrange · predicted</span><div><div>Velocity</div><div><span>Vertical</span><span><span data-figure="">350 <span data-unit="m/s" data-tooltip="metres per second"><span aria-hidden="true">m/s</span><span data-unit-word=""> metres per second</span></span></span></span><span>Horizontal</span><span><span data-figure="">100.0 <span data-unit="m/s" data-tooltip="metres per second"><span aria-hidden="true">m/s</span><span data-unit-word=""> metres per second</span></span></span></span></div></div><div style="color: var(--color-text-faint); --color-neutral-text: var(--color-text-faint); --color-text-primary: var(--color-text-faint); --color-text-muted: var(--color-text-faint); --color-text-dim: var(--color-text-faint);"><div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;"><span>Burn dV</span><span><span data-figure="">556 <span data-unit="m/s" data-tooltip="metres per second"><span aria-hidden="true">m/s</span><span data-unit-word=""> metres per second</span></span></span></span></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;"><span>Burn duration</span><span><span data-figure="">2min 12s</span></span></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;"><span>Available dV (ACT)</span><span><span data-figure="">900 <span data-unit="m/s" data-tooltip="metres per second"><span aria-hidden="true">m/s</span><span data-unit-word=""> metres per second</span></span></span></span></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;"><span>Affordable</span><span><span>n/a · no path</span></span></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;"><span>Touchdown (coast)</span><span><span data-figure="">409 <span data-unit="m/s" data-tooltip="metres per second"><span aria-hidden="true">m/s</span><span data-unit-word=""> metres per second</span></span></sp